{"lines":[{"t":"Test 1","x":0.84775572697688972,"y":0.047898250808653509,"w":0.059787197113037149,"h":0.01466861460943647,"c":1},{"y":0.094243451493173813,"w":0.69762807210286448,"h":0.016501628827748749,"t":"Some of you have already asked me about flexible working. After your probationary three-","c":1,"x":0.0904921828162773},{"t":"month period - some of you will be eligible for this - but it will depend on which department","w":0.71098266601562499,"x":0.088631980876449939,"h":0.014534884278879168,"y":0.11191860436808243,"c":1},{"x":0.086654302153397353,"t":"you're in and what your personal circumstances are. So please don't assume you'll","c":1,"y":0.1261078432466074,"w":0.64943384806315108,"h":0.01703184955524939},{"y":0.1438953485798431,"t":"automatically be permitted to do this.","x":0.09055877030401821,"h":0.013081395850991329,"c":1,"w":0.28901733398437501},{"t":"I want to make sure there's no confusion about our holiday policy. Apart from any","h":0.016072885045465446,"y":0.16632835174494209,"x":0.088552786351864463,"w":0.62830037434895836,"c":1},{"w":0.70337855021158857,"h":0.017125561552227664,"y":0.18273667844619357,"c":1,"t":"statutory public holidays we ask that you don't book any holidays until after your six-month","x":0.088576355776383009},{"w":0.71879562377929684,"h":0.017379007999252183,"t":"apprenticeship has finished. Time off should only be taken if you are unwell. Please speak to","y":0.19868878484247943,"x":0.088581294974354421,"c":1},{"h":0.014562308113529987,"t":"your supervisor if this is going to be a problem.","x":0.086705207306630241,"y":0.2165697671570721,"w":0.37379575093587242,"c":1},{"t":"You'll be expected to work a 40-hour week but there may be opportunities to do overtime","x":0.090511394060522249,"y":0.23980415635703245,"h":0.015126527030512982,"c":1,"w":0.68794820149739588},{"y":0.25467088801060545,"c":1,"t":"during busy periods. Although you're not required to do this, it can be a valuable experience.","x":0.088538164728537844,"w":0.71696177164713548,"h":0.019687211138647354},{"h":0.014534884278879279,"t":"- so we advise you to take it up it possible. Obviously, we understand that people do have","w":0.69749516805013023,"y":0.27325581367215435,"c":1,"x":0.090558774267605599},{"c":1,"t":"commitments outside work, so don't worry if there are times when you are unavailable.","x":0.088631992727807238,"y":0.28924418576527311,"h":0.014534884278879168,"w":0.67437377929687503},{"y":0.31249999971900122,"w":0.72254333496093748,"h":0.014544025157232632,"c":1,"t":"As you know, we don't have a formal dress code here - you may wear casual clothes as long","x":0.090558775579358056},{"t":"as they're practical - and the only restriction for shoes we have is on high heels for health","y":0.32703488381399892,"w":0.69749516805013023,"x":0.088631995695551302,"h":0.016046877327205222,"c":1},{"x":0.08863198272691615,"y":0.3443396229315373,"w":0.52215799967447907,"c":1,"h":0.014779874213836419,"t":"and safety reasons. Comfortable shoes like trainers are preferable."},{"h":0.014538540630220642,"c":1,"t":"There's a heavily subsidised canteen on site where you can get hot meals or salads cheaply.","x":0.088631991239553259,"y":0.36918238987911633,"w":0.72061655680338543},{"w":0.68400772094726559,"h":0.014534884278879279,"y":0.38517441832350086,"c":1,"t":"Snacks and drinks are also provided - so we've decided to introduce a no packed lunch","x":0.088631977574836665},{"h":0.016132806382089249,"w":0.7263969421386719,"t":"policy. This is partly to encourage healthy eating at work and partly to stop people from eating","c":1,"x":0.088631971999093367,"y":0.40116279098823249},{"t":"at their workstation, which is unhygienic.","x":0.088500695815905459,"w":0.31622156778971355,"c":1,"h":0.017953555389020437,"y":0.41633969326171549},{"c":1,"t":"OK moving on to ...","x":0.090558764022063365,"w":0.15221580505371093,"y":0.4418238995420205,"h":0.013207547169811429},{"y":0.18459302296839963,"w":0.036608864466349367,"h":0.013081395850991329,"t":"Q17","x":0.82466281237718719,"c":1},{"t":"Q18","h":0.013081395850991218,"y":0.25726744157305093,"c":1,"w":0.036608864466349367,"x":0.82466281237718719},{"w":0.034682079950968281,"x":0.82658959577199398,"y":0.34447674389649485,"h":0.013081395850991218,"c":1,"t":"Q19"},{"x":0.82658959577199398,"w":0.034682079950968281,"y":0.38517441831509946,"c":1,"t":"Q20","h":0.013081395850991329},{"w":0.15028901418050128,"y":0.50000000027342517,"h":0.016037735849056656,"x":0.090558768359723485,"t":"SECTION 3","c":1},{"t":"TUTOR.","h":0.0087209299675323759,"c":1,"x":0.090558766233977767,"y":0.53343023267321055,"w":0.050096340179443366},{"t":"CARLA:","w":0.05009633700052897,"x":0.090558768493955152,"c":1,"y":0.59593023279307888,"h":0.010174417795625113},{"w":0.036608861287434902,"t":"ROB:","h":0.010174417795625113,"x":0.090558768168100129,"y":0.62790697697912545,"c":1},{"w":0.050313291549682615,"y":0.6595708092186372,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.090450291215567802,"h":0.010800241674267186,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.69331395326316525,"h":0.010174418995215428,"t":"ROB:","x":0.092485549529219405,"w":0.034682079950968434},{"h":0.013352975905316367,"y":0.7237014188582197,"w":0.050219815572102866,"c":1,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.090497029062088646},{"h":0.011627906223513063,"x":0.090558767405415519,"c":1,"t":"ROB:","y":0.74127906999870852,"w":0.036608861287434902},{"y":0.8052325579239038,"t":"CARLA:","w":0.050096340179443366,"c":1,"h":0.010174418995215539,"x":0.090558766233977767},{"y":0.8197674420917318,"h":0.011627906223512952,"x":0.0924855498607393,"w":0.034682079950968406,"c":1,"t":"ROB:"},{"h":0.010174418995215428,"w":0.050096337000528957,"y":0.85174418574948541,"x":0.092485550497808738,"c":1,"t":"CARLA:"},{"x":0.090558768079789284,"y":0.86773255837080154,"h":0.011627906223512952,"c":1,"t":"ROB:","w":0.036608861287434888},{"x":0.09055876712258458,"t":"CARLA:","y":0.89970930258591775,"w":0.052023121515909834,"h":0.011627906223513063,"c":1},{"t":"ROB.","c":1,"y":0.91715116255907836,"x":0.092485549509789683,"w":0.03468207995096842,"h":0.010174418995215428},{"h":0.014554995410847149,"c":1,"t":"OK, so what I'd like you to do now is to talk to your partner about your","x":0.18497109360508962,"w":0.54335261027018222,"y":0.53050314440021595},{"c":1,"y":0.54651162762519623,"x":0.18497109215178131,"w":0.58959538777669274,"t":"presentations on urban planning. You should have done most of the reading","h":0.014534884278879279},{"y":0.56249999971811848,"w":0.58574183146158854,"t":"now, so I'd like you to share your ideas, and talk about the structure of your","h":0.014544025157232743,"c":1,"x":0.18497108803182613},{"w":0.33555412292480469,"t":"presentation and what you need to do next.","h":0.0168594648253243,"x":0.18673518653048968,"y":0.57626032164419039,"c":1},{"w":0.61482991536458331,"h":0.018431349820311027,"c":1,"t":"OK Rob. I'm glad we chose quite a specific topic - cities built next to the sea. It","x":0.18488843159195814,"y":0.59164120991823954},{"x":0.18689788345841757,"w":0.37186897277832037,"h":0.011715665253453245,"c":1,"y":0.61037735822207961,"t":"made it much easier to find relevant information."},{"y":0.62497177715886709,"w":0.60898554484049483,"x":0.18492122636379377,"h":0.018406093045600591,"c":1,"t":"Yeah. And cities are growing so quickly - I mean, we know that more than half"},{"w":0.31599230448404952,"t":"the world's population lives in cities now.","x":0.18497109236596448,"h":0.013218517423425835,"c":1,"y":0.64244186020729621},{"c":1,"t":"Yeah, though that's all cities, not just ones on the coast. But most of the biggest","x":0.18491402125052864,"w":0.6224664306640626,"h":0.018351503888016207,"y":0.65669149319512654},{"x":0.18497110503955166,"t":"cities are actually built by the sea. I'd not realised that before.","y":0.67295597489398973,"w":0.47784200032552088,"h":0.016037735849056545,"c":1},{"h":0.019305431317983235,"c":1,"x":0.18486825752544414,"y":0.68826570128400355,"w":0.62644429524739587,"t":"Nor me. And what's more, a lot of them are built at places where rivers come out"},{"h":0.014534884278879279,"x":0.18304432022707298,"w":0.39691713968912767,"t":"into the sea. But apparently this can be a problem.","c":1,"y":0.70784883692660094},{"t":"Why?","x":0.18497109876157827,"w":0.048169555664062502,"h":0.014534883079288963,"y":0.72383720959286524,"c":1},{"t":"Well, as the city expands, agriculture and industry tend to spread further inland","x":0.18491863052118182,"h":0.017911178061047472,"w":0.61285049438476558,"c":1,"y":0.73802710732522081},{"y":0.75356917782096755,"w":0.57624888102213545,"x":0.18490069149545063,"h":0.01760138385700738,"c":1,"t":"along the rivers, and so agriculture moves even further inland up the river."},{"t":"That's not necessarily a problem, except it means more and more pollutants are","x":0.1868978860268794,"w":0.62427744547526043,"c":1,"y":0.77034883749944016,"h":0.016129150030747885},{"t":"discharged into the rivers.","x":0.1847949525492471,"y":0.78631786317877805,"h":0.016088454528424778,"c":1,"w":0.20467035929361976},{"t":"So these are brought downstream to the cities?","x":0.18681456611833133,"w":0.3701336161295572,"y":0.80227058573289634,"h":0.016648231362396793,"c":1},{"y":0.81674651202256976,"x":0.18683825353107589,"h":0.017276453222118793,"w":0.58393976847330731,"t":"Right. Hmm. Did you read that article about Miami, on the east coast of the","c":1},{"h":0.011627907423103379,"c":1,"t":"USA?","x":0.18689788103116722,"y":0.83430232533293769,"w":0.048169555664062474},{"w":0.036608864466349256,"y":0.65697674389409011,"x":0.82658959465145931,"c":1,"h":0.013081395850991329,"t":"Q21"},{"x":0.82658959632053008,"y":0.76889534907728063,"h":0.014534883079288963,"t":"Q22","c":1,"w":0.036608861287435013},{"h":0.018677114090829505,"x":0.18489962500277624,"t":"Well, apparently back in the 1950s they built channels to drain away the water in","w":0.62829081217447913,"c":1,"y":0.86329949271437745},{"t":"case of flooding.","x":0.18862597924294497,"c":1,"w":0.12958282470703122,"h":0.014558648163417565,"y":0.88099061453912864},{"h":0.014815759958711094,"c":1,"y":0.89811556503630674,"w":0.13732671101888019,"t":"Sounds sensible.","x":0.18665083040434591},{"w":0.67843282063802079,"y":0.91118974787639084,"x":0.1868058496196312,"c":1,"h":0.018990591037198468,"t":"Yeah, they spent quite a lot of money on them. But what they didn't take into account. Q23"},{"x":0.1868978841552027,"w":0.62235066731770827,"y":0.92877907005316318,"c":1,"t":"was global warming. So they built the drainage channels too close to sea level, and","h":0.015988371507176802},{"t":"99","h":0.014534883079288852,"w":0.0250481700897216,"x":0.88631984549463827,"c":1,"y":0.95203488397568314}],"h":3179,"w":2400}